      "writtenOn": "2019-02-01T22:09:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually, we don\u0027t log PhoneStatus when the phone state changed. We only maintain the phone status in TelephonMetrics.java and log the data when needs. \n\nFor example, in DSDS we care about the phone_count, inserted_sim_count, enabled_modem_count, all the data are currently in PhoneStatus, so we will log PhoneStatus when with the event DSDS_STATUS_CHANGED when DSDS status changed. \n\nFor the sms/call session, you could log the sim status when sms/call happened.",
      "parentUuid": "24273956_2817e34f",
