      "writtenOn": "2019-02-01T19:16:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This description is not accurate. We don\u0027t care about physical slots.\nFor example, on the Pixel 3, there are 2 physical slots (eSIM and pSIM), but we would be tracking only one slot (whichever is active).\n\nCan you remove the word \"physical\"?\n\nMaybe we can expand saying that this array has the same length as phone_count?",
